{"title":"Career roadmap — Product Designer","role":"Product Designer","summary":"A Product Designer designs physical products by combining user needs, ergonomics, materials, manufacturing, aesthetics, technology, sustainability and business requirements. The role can cover consumer electronics, furniture, appliances, mobility, medical devices, tools, packaging, lifestyle products and smart connected products.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Product / Industrial Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this degree, the strongest profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Industrial Design","Human-Centred Design","3D CAD","Prototyping","Manufacturing","Product Strategy"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build design fundamentals, sketching, ergonomics, CAD, materials and prototyping"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Work as Junior Product/Industrial Designer and develop manufacturing-ready product experience"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress into Senior Product Designer, Product Design Lead or Design Strategist"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead product-design teams, innovation programmes, design strategy or independent product ventures"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Design foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design principles"},{"text":"Form and proportion"},{"text":"Visual composition"},{"text":"Colour theory"},{"text":"Design history"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Perspective drawing"},{"text":"Product sketching"},{"text":"Technical drawing"},{"text":"Basic ergonomics"},{"text":"Human-centred design"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Practise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Daily product sketches"},{"text":"Exploded-view drawings"},{"text":"Form exploration"},{"text":"Everyday-object redesign"},{"text":"Physical model making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Start analysing products around you:"},{"type":"p","text":"Why is it shaped this way? Why this material? How is it manufactured? How does the user hold it? What could be improved?"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Industrial design technology"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D CAD"},{"text":"Surface modelling"},{"text":"Parametric modelling"},{"text":"Engineering drawings"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Manufacturing processes"},{"text":"Injection moulding"},{"text":"CNC"},{"text":"3D printing"},{"text":"Sheet metal"},{"text":"Woodworking"},{"text":"Casting"},{"text":"Rapid prototyping"},{"text":"Design for manufacturing and assembly"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Rhino"},{"text":"SolidWorks"},{"text":"Fusion"},{"text":"KeyShot"},{"text":"Blender"},{"text":"Adobe Illustrator"},{"text":"Photoshop"},{"text":"Figma"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — User-centred product development"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete product-development cycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research","Problem Definition","Ideation","Sketching","CAD","Prototype","Testing","Refinement","Manufacturing"]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User research"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Persona development"},{"text":"Journey mapping"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"Product benchmarking"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Ergonomics"},{"text":"Design validation"},{"text":"Sustainability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete product from research to working prototype."},{"type":"p","text":"Strong project examples:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Smart home appliance"},{"text":"Sustainable kitchen product"},{"text":"Assistive device"},{"text":"Mobility product"},{"text":"Healthcare device"},{"text":"Consumer electronics product"},{"text":"Sustainable furniture"},{"text":"Agricultural tool"},{"text":"Educational product"},{"text":"Travel product"},{"text":"Wearable device"},{"text":"Smart lifestyle product"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The final portfolio should show process, not only beautiful final renders."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Focus","Potential careers"],"rows":[[{"text":"Consumer Products"},{"text":"Everyday products"},{"text":"Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Consumer Electronics"},{"text":"Devices and gadgets"},{"text":"Industrial Designer"}],[{"text":"Furniture"},{"text":"Furniture systems"},{"text":"Furniture Designer"}],[{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"Vehicle interiors/exteriors"},{"text":"Automotive Designer"}],[{"text":"Medical Devices"},{"text":"Healthcare products"},{"text":"Medical Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Transport products"},{"text":"Mobility Designer"}],[{"text":"Appliances"},{"text":"Home appliances"},{"text":"Appliance Designer"}],[{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Physical packaging"},{"text":"Packaging Designer"}],[{"text":"Wearables"},{"text":"Smart/connected products"},{"text":"Wearable Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Design"},{"text":"Circular products"},{"text":"Sustainable Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Sports Products"},{"text":"Equipment"},{"text":"Sports Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Design Strategy"},{"text":"Product innovation"},{"text":"Design Strategist"}]]},{"type":"flow","items":["Design","CAD","Prototyping","Manufacturing","User Research"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consumer-product companies"},{"text":"Industrial-design studios"},{"text":"Consumer-electronics companies"},{"text":"Automotive companies"},{"text":"Furniture brands"},{"text":"Appliance manufacturers"},{"text":"Medical-device companies"},{"text":